  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Law Enforcement Assistance Programme to Reduce Tropical Deforestation (LEAP) - Phase III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to reduce forest crime in selected rainforest countries through bulding capacity and facilitating national and cross-national cooperation between law enforecement agencies such as police and customs</narrative>
  </description>
